{"ticker":"FICO","updated":"2026-11-20T22:55:20Z","profile":{"longName":"Fair Isaac Corporation","shortName":"Fair Isaac Corporation","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"United States","website":"https://www.fico.com","fullTimeEmployees":3747,"marketCap":14844992512,"trailingPE":19.116465,"forwardPE":13.612264,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.856306,"pegRatio":0.64,"targetMeanPrice":821.3668,"targetHighPrice":1230.97,"targetLowPrice":481.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.274,"earningsGrowth":0.265,"grossMargins":0.86134005,"operatingMargins":0.51008,"profitMargins":0.32939,"totalRevenue":2534873088,"beta":1.338,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1858.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":586.05,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Fair Isaac Corporation provides analytics software in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and the Asia Pacific. It operates through two segments, Scores and Software. The Scores segment offers business-to-business scoring solutions and services that give clients access to predictive credit and other scores that can be integrated into their transaction streams and decision-making processes, as well as business-to-consumer scoring solutions comprising myFICO.com subscription offerings. Its Software segment provides pre-configured analytic and decision management solution designed for various business needs or processes, such as account origination, customer management, customer engagement, fraud detection, and marketing, as well as associated professional services. This segment also offers FICO Platform, a modular software offering designed to support advanced analytic and decision use cases, as well as stand-alone analytic and decisioning software that can be configured by customers to address a wide range of business use cases. In addition, the company offers analytic and decisioning software comprising FICO Decision Modeler, FICO Blaze Advisor, FICO Xpress Optimization, FICO Analytics Workbench, FICO Data Orchestrator, FICO DMP Streaming, FICO Business Outcome Simulator, and FICO Decision Optimizer; pre-configured solutions consisting of FICO Fraud Solutions, FICO O","summary_zh":"Fair Isaac Corporation 在美洲、歐洲、中東、非洲和亞太地區提供分析軟體。它透過兩個部門運作：樂譜部門和軟體部門。分數部門提供企業對企業評分解決方案和服務，使客戶能夠獲得可整合到其交易流程和決策流程中的預測信用和其他評分，以及包含 myFICO.com 訂閱產品的企業對消費者評分解決方案。其軟體部門提供預先配置的分析和決策管理解決方案，專為各種業務需求或流程而設計，例如帳戶發起、客戶管理、客戶參與、詐欺檢測和行銷以及相關的專業服務。該部門還提供 FICO 平台，這是一種模組化軟體產品，旨在支援高級分析和決策用例，以及可由客戶配置以解決各種業務用例的獨立分析和決策軟體。此外，該公司還提供分析和決策軟體，包括 FICO Decision Modeler、FICO Blaze Advisor、FICO Xpress Optimization、FICO Analytics Workbench、FICO Data Orchestrator、FICO DMP Streaming、FICO Business Outcome Simulator 和 FICO Decision Optimizer；預配置解決方案包括 FICO Fra Solutions、FICO","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"軟體 - 應用程式","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-22","o":1475.0,"h":1546.6,"l":1460.91,"c":1538.95,"v":298400},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":1548.6801,"h":1550.65,"l":1515.5601,"c":1534.77,"v":163000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":1527.62,"h":1556.59,"l":1526.8199,"c":1543.1801,"v":136600},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":1533.61,"h":1553.1899,"l":1516.3199,"c":1548.36,"v":173700},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":1542.99,"h":1562.2,"l":1511.55,"c":1518.78,"v":199000},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":1521.05,"h":1542.25,"l":1520.21,"c":1525.4399,"v":144300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":1523.5,"h":1523.9399,"l":1488.4,"c":1496.53,"v":262300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":1506.3101,"h":1535.0,"l":1484.23,"c":1512.71,"v":238700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":1785.5,"h":1998.01,"l":1692.33,"c":1784.6801,"v":1710100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":1786.87,"h":1880.16,"l":1786.83,"c":1850.65,"v":598500},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":1862.12,"h":1886.28,"l":1829.12,"c":1850.1801,"v":482200},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":1841.79,"h":1881.21,"l":1825.0,"c":1879.55,"v":362800},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":1821.39,"h":1835.9301,"l":1688.6899,"c":1695.01,"v":770800},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":1693.4,"h":1730.23,"l":1672.66,"c":1708.77,"v":322100},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":1716.89,"h":1723.5699,"